BitChord — NOTICE

BitChord is an unofficial, independent third-party player. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Google LLC, YouTube,
YouTube Music, Deezer, Telegram, Discord, Last.fm, or ListenBrainz.

Third-party names, marks, artwork, and logos referenced by this project
(such as YouTube, YouTube Music, and Google) remain the property of
their respective owners. They are named here only to describe
compatibility (nominative use) and imply no endorsement.

This project ships no media files and hosts no music. All playback,
artwork, and metadata come from the user's own local files, the user's
own authenticated accounts, or user-configured sources.

Service endpoints, client identities, and link hosts are not in this
repository at all: they arrive in a user-imported service file (see
README.md). The only network names kept in code are the auth guard
suffixes in ServiceConfig, a safety valve that restricts where the
session cookie may be sent — never an endpoint.

